      "evidence_role": "contradictory"
    }
  ],
  "confidence": "moderate",
  "decision_summary": "Multiple structurally similar compounds show direct in vivo brain penetration after systemic administration, with brain/plasma ratios >0.9-3.7 and high brain concentrations in rodents; this outweighs a single negative analog, supporting meaningful CNS access.",
